{"id": 395321, "ru": "(16:27:57) virtuoso: Since the main goal of any Linux distribution developed for embedded systems is having a Linux distribution that can be installed in an embedded target hardware, a rootfs is required for the distribution that will be installed on the target hardware and this is it.\n(16:30:34) virtuoso: Поскольку основная цель масла -- маслиться, то масло должно маслиться, маслом, по маслу, об масло, масло масло масло. Масло.", "en": "(16:27:57) virtuoso: Since the main goal of any Linux distribution developed for embedded systems is having a Linux distribution that can be installed in an embedded target hardware, a rootfs is required for the distribution that will be installed on the target hardware and this is it.\n(16:30:34) virtuoso: Since the main goal of butter is to be buttery, butter must butter, with butter, along butter, against butter, butter butter butter. Butter."}
{"id": 395322, "ru": "zzz:  xxxxxxx - точно верный номер аси этого товарища? \nА то я опасаюсь вступать в деловую переписку с человеком, у которого единственная вменяемая инфа в асе состоит из \"А не пойти бы тебе нахуй?\"", "en": "zzz:  xxxxxxx - is that really this guy's ICQ number? \nBecause I'm a bit afraid to start business correspondence with a person whose only sane info in ICQ is \"Why don't you go fuck yourself?\""}
